packages/
*.nupkg

## SQLite: ignore the temporary journal/WAL files, but COMMIT the seeded database
## (ynclino.db) so teammates get a ready-to-run, pre-populated copy on clone.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db
!ynclino.db

